        "thought_text": "Consider using modular arithmetic properties to determine if a valid multiple exists without explicitly iterating through all multiples of A. Specifically, check if \\( C \\) is a multiple of \\( B \\) within the range of multiples of \\( A \\). This can be done by verifying if \\( C \\) is congruent to 0 modulo \\( B \\) when reduced by multiples of \\( A \\).",
